  "bodyHash": "7d921ddc6bfdaa70",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jktGQ4XC/Lios-Outlandish-Village-Spiral-Towers.png\" alt=\"Lios-Outlandish-Village-Spiral-Towers\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Spiral Tower Villages（螺旋塔村庄）</strong>&nbsp;为你的世界带来了直插云霄的建筑、自定义的周边世界生成以及每层都充满层层谜题的体验。这些垂直避难所由远古时期为躲避下方危险而逃亡的村民建造，虽能提供庇护&mdash;&mdash;却并非绝对安全。为了保护他们最珍贵的财物，村民在塔内设置了隐蔽的红石机关。如今，秘密触发器和隐藏的密室散落于各座高塔之中，守护着稀有的战利品与被遗忘的遗物，等待勇敢的探索者去发掘。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基于数据包的配置？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        试试 <strong>LioLoader</strong>，支持全局加载数据包/资源包。适用于 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong> 平台。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">在 Modrinth 上打开 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9HZwsP9v/towers8.png\" alt=\"towers8\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FqB3NwGL/towers3.png\" alt=\"towers3\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kWBQpD5/towers7.png\" alt=\"towers7\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HT8tF2By/towers1.png\" alt=\"towers1\" border=\"0\">  <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNyQtsW3/towers2.png\" alt=\"towers2\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4w9qPp8C/towers9.png\" alt=\"towers9\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zT1pXxTy/towers4.png\" alt=\"towers4\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n2n5BVr/towers5.png\" alt=\"towers5\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rGZW9xQb/towers10.png\" alt=\"towers10\" border=\"0\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4njsCD1B/towers6.png\" alt=\"towers6\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XrhYLBjD/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"536\" height=\"49\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>本模组不会覆盖现有的原版村庄，因此可与任何其他村庄重制模组兼容，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lios-overhauled-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio's Overhauled Villages</a>！作为全新系列“Lio's Outlandish Villages”的一部分，该系列旨在带来风格独特的城镇与充满冒险感的建筑供玩家探索！</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RTMvjThM/features.png\" alt=\"features\" width=\"458\" height=\"62\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自定义战利品表：</strong>每个箱子都经过精心调校，提供独特的奖励组合，包含实用装备、稀有发现以及专为每座高塔定制的主题物品。</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏背景故事：</strong>部分密室中藏有古老的村民日记&mdash;&mdash;这些文字记录揭示了他们生活的片段、高塔的由来历史，以及曾经面临的威胁。</li>\n<li><strong>高度独特性：</strong>生成池中包含超过 40 种不同的塔楼变体，没有任何两座螺旋村庄是完全相同的&mdash;&mdash;每座都提供全新的布局与探索体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0phQs4Sb/morefromthisseries.png\" alt=\"morefromthisseries\" width=\"669\" height=\"57\" border=\"0\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hobbit-hill-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdsDc7TH/banner.png\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"345\" height=\"63\" border=\"0\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n<p>-11:31 处评测-<br><iframe title=\"TOP 20 NEW Minecraft Mods Of The Month! (1.21.7 to 1.20.1) | July\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j5bxrkqWJkg?start=690\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-7:40 处评测-<br><div style=\"left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QxYuzW_sFMg?rel=0&start=465\" style=\"top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute; border: 0;\" allowfullscreen scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"accelerometer *; clipboard-write *; encrypted-media *; gyroscope *; picture-in-picture *; web-share *;\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"></a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">模组包中的使用</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">欢迎将 <strong>Spiral Tower Villages</strong> 自由加入你选择的任何 Minecraft 模组包中。我们鼓励你将这些垂直村庄结构融入你的自定义模组包，打造独特且引人入胜的冒险体验。无需申请许可&mdash;&mdash;尽情探索并按你的喜好搭配这些村庄高塔吧！</p>",
